{%- comment -%}
	price: one amount, the way every price on the site reads: the currency's
	code, then the amount, and no ".00" on a whole amount ("AED 184",
	"SAR 192", "AED 133.20"). Western digits in every language (CLAUDE.md
	rule 10), and a no-break space keeps the code and the amount together.
	Shopify's own checkout keeps its own format.
	Params:
	  cents: the amount in the shopper's currency, in cents (what Liquid
	         gives prices and money sums in)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
	assign price_amount = cents | money_without_currency
	assign price_tail = price_amount | slice: -3, 3
	if price_tail == '.00'
		assign price_amount = price_amount | remove_last: '.00'
	endif
	echo cart.currency.iso_code | append: ' ' | append: price_amount
-%}
